source_event:           librasterlite2 1.1.0-beta1 r47 real OHOS target run observed unsigned INT8 promotions; r49 rebuilt the same 71-test inventory with -fsigned-char and repaired 23 of the 24 failures. The remaining test_map_ascii failure had no unsigned-promotion symptoms; r65 disproved fixture restoration, r68/r70 isolated a separate tmpfile EACCES and mkstemp fallback boundary, and r196 passed 71/71 upstream tests plus the consumer's 14/14 assertions.

